    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "もうすぐ冬馬君の誕生日だよね！\nどうしよっか？　何食べる～？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "御手洗 翔太"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "002sht"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "002sht",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 5
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_2_001_02_a:step-5:text",
        "step_id": 5,
        "step_index": 4,
        "source_part_id": "1_2_001_02_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "何を食べるかの相談から入るなんて、翔太らしいね。\nその前に一つ、相談があるんだけどいいかな。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "伊集院 北斗"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "003hok"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "003hok",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 6
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_2_001_02_a:step-6:text",
        "step_id": 6,
        "step_index": 5,
        "source_part_id": "1_2_001_02_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "相談？　別にいいけど、何かな？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "御手洗 翔太"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "002sht"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "002sht",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 7
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_2_001_02_a:step-7:text",
        "step_id": 7,
        "step_index": 6,
        "source_part_id": "1_2_001_02_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "今回の誕生日は、俺たちで料理を\n作るのはどうかと思ってね。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "伊集院 北斗"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "003hok"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "003hok",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 8
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_2_001_02_a:step-8:text",
        "step_id": 8,
        "step_index": 7,
        "source_part_id": "1_2_001_02_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "えっ、北斗君って料理できたっけ？　冬馬君の\n手伝いをしてるところは見たことあるけど……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "御手洗 翔太"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "002sht"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "002sht",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 9
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_2_001_02_a:step-9:text",
        "step_id": 9,
        "step_index": 8,
        "source_part_id": "1_2_001_02_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "うん。冬馬みたいにあまり凝ったものは\n難しいけど、最低限は作れるよ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "伊集院 北斗"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "003hok"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "003hok",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 10
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_2_001_02_a:step-10:text",
        "step_id": 10,
        "step_index": 9,
        "source_part_id": "1_2_001_02_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ふーん。そうなんだ。\n僕は今回も味見係でいい？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "御手洗 翔太"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "002sht"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "002sht",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 11
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_2_001_02_a:step-11:text",
        "step_id": 11,
        "step_index": 10,
        "source_part_id": "1_2_001_02_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "頼んだよ。\n翔太の評価は的を射ていて参考になるからね。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "伊集院 北斗"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "003hok"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "003hok",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 12
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_2_001_02_a:step-12:text",
        "step_id": 12,
        "step_index": 11,
        "source_part_id": "1_2_001_02_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "もう、冗談だよ。\n僕も家庭科で習ったことくらいは手伝うから！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "御手洗 翔太"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "002sht"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "002sht",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 13
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
